  "analysis": {
    "summary": "A non-stop eighth-note line through two quick ii–Vs. After the opening rest, every beat carries a chord tone, and at every chord change a 3rd or 7th moves by half steps into the next chord: the 7th of {{chord 1}} falls to the 3rd of {{chord 2}}, the 7th of {{chord 2}} slides down two half steps to the b3 of {{chord 3}}, the 7th of {{chord 3}} falls to the 3rd of {{chord 4}}, and an enclosure delivers the 3rd of {{chord 5}} on beat one.",
    "points": [
      {
        "topic": "chord-tones",
