          ]
        ],
        "text": "{{note 1.4}}, the 7th of {{chord 1}}, falls a half step to {{note 1.5}}, the 3rd of {{chord 2}}; {{note 2.4}}, the 7th of {{chord 3}}, falls a half step to {{note 2.5}}, the 3rd of {{chord 4}}. In between, {{note 1.7}} (the 7th of {{chord 2}}) heads for {{note 2.1}} (the b3 of {{chord 3}}). Three of the chords are spelled straight up from 3rd to 7th, and {{chord 3}} comes down from its b3 to its 7th."
      },
      {
