          ]
        ],
        "text": "{{note 1.8}} is a chromatic passing note that carries the 7th of {{chord 2}} down to the b3 of {{chord 3}}, and {{note 2.2}} is a passing step on the way down. At the end, {{note 2.7}} (the 7th of {{chord 4}}) and {{note 2.8}} surround the target from above and below: a classic bebop enclosure."
      },
