        "text": "The line starts on the 'and' of beat one and runs in unbroken eighth notes to the landing. From beat two on, a chord tone sits on every beat, and the chromatic and passing notes all fall on the 'ands', where they sound like movement rather than wrong notes."
      },
      {
        "topic": "resolution",
