        ],
        "text": "{{note 3.1}} is the 3rd of {{chord 5}}, on beat one. It is exactly where the 7th of {{chord 4}} wants to go, a half step down, and the enclosure around it makes the arrival sound inevitable."
      }
    ],
    "resolution": {
